{"events":[{"tStartMs":160,"dDurationMs":2400,"segs":[{"utf8":"A portion of the video is sponsored by Capital One Shopping."}]},{"tStartMs":7520,"dDurationMs":2480,"segs":[{"utf8":"You can see it working! It's actually working!"}]},{"tStartMs":11120,"dDurationMs":2240,"segs":[{"utf8":"Every Batman movie. No."}]},{"tStartMs":13360,"dDurationMs":1200,"segs":[{"utf8":"Every Batman comic."}]},{"tStartMs":15120,"dDurationMs":2640,"segs":[{"utf8":"No. Everything Batman is a lie!"}]},{"tStartMs":17760,"dDurationMs":4320,"segs":[{"utf8":"And no I'm not talking about how an average rich boy with no superpowers somehow"}]},{"tStartMs":22080,"dDurationMs":5040,"segs":[{"utf8":"manages to hold his own in a justice league full of actual superheroes and literal gods..."}]},{"tStartMs":27120,"dDurationMs":1600,"segs":[{"utf8":"I'm talking about the bat signal."}]},{"tStartMs":28720,"dDurationMs":3440,"segs":[{"utf8":"The famous giant spotlight that Commissioner Gordon uses to summon batman"}]},{"tStartMs":32160,"dDurationMs":2880,"segs":[{"utf8":"I mean nowadays I'm sure Bruce could just pick up a burner phone,"}]},{"tStartMs":35040,"dDurationMs":2880,"segs":[{"utf8":"but back in the 1930s cell phones were a long way off."}]},{"tStartMs":37920,"dDurationMs":1281,"segs":[{"utf8":"\"Why this is Batman\""}]},{"tStartMs":39360,"dDurationMs":2720,"segs":[{"utf8":"Also what happens if they need Batman during the day?"}]},{"tStartMs":42640,"dDurationMs":5040,"segs":[{"utf8":"Anyways why is it a lie? Well it simply would never ever work."}]},{"tStartMs":47680,"dDurationMs":2800,"segs":[{"utf8":"At least not in the way it's been portrayed so far."}]},{"tStartMs":50480,"dDurationMs":2800,"segs":[{"utf8":"It's simply just not how projectors actually work."}]},{"tStartMs":53840,"dDurationMs":4000,"segs":[{"utf8":"I mean this scene from Batman Forever?"}]},{"tStartMs":58560,"dDurationMs":1840,"segs":[{"utf8":"Nope not a chance in hell."}]},{"tStartMs":60400,"dDurationMs":2240,"segs":[{"utf8":"But that's what Make it Real is all about."}]},{"tStartMs":62640,"dDurationMs":3440,"segs":[{"utf8":"We take those crazy ideas from comics and make it real."}]},{"tStartMs":66080,"dDurationMs":5120,"segs":[{"utf8":"So let's figure out how we can make a real working bat signal that actually projects on the clouds!"}]},{"tStartMs":71200,"dDurationMs":3600,"segs":[{"utf8":"Now you might remember Chris from our Guinness world record setting giant flashlight."}]},{"tStartMs":74800,"dDurationMs":2000,"segs":[{"utf8":"Something tells me that his experience is going to"}]},{"tStartMs":76800,"dDurationMs":3520,"segs":[{"utf8":"come in handy and I think he's the perfect guy to manage this project."}]},{"tStartMs":80320,"dDurationMs":1360,"segs":[{"utf8":"So let's Make it Real."}]},{"tStartMs":82640,"dDurationMs":3440,"segs":[{"utf8":"So you might be wondering why don't we just try a big spotlight?"}]},{"tStartMs":86080,"dDurationMs":3520,"segs":[{"utf8":"That's what I thought, so we bought one."}]},{"tStartMs":89600,"dDurationMs":4400,"segs":[{"utf8":"And we have this bat symbol and we're just gonna slap it on the front and wham bat signal!"}]},{"tStartMs":94000,"dDurationMs":5840,"segs":[{"utf8":"Just like the movies. That was easy."}]},{"tStartMs":101920,"dDurationMs":2320,"segs":[{"utf8":"Oh you do you want me to turn it on?"}]},{"tStartMs":104240,"dDurationMs":9600,"segs":[{"utf8":"Yeah we can do that. We can test it."}]},{"tStartMs":116560,"dDurationMs":2240,"segs":[{"utf8":"Yeah that ain't gonna work."}]},{"tStartMs":118800,"dDurationMs":2000,"segs":[{"utf8":"No freaks and tights showing up tonight."}]},{"tStartMs":120800,"dDurationMs":1120,"segs":[{"utf8":"Darrly: Hey Chris."}]},{"tStartMs":126960,"dDurationMs":2400,"segs":[{"utf8":"So this doesn't work for a couple of reasons."}]},{"tStartMs":131600,"dDurationMs":4800,"segs":[{"utf8":"First we're gonna need a cloudy night in order to project the image onto something."}]},{"tStartMs":136400,"dDurationMs":5120,"segs":[{"utf8":"Our spotlight acted as a great light pillar in the night sky but if we want an image to show up"}]},{"tStartMs":141520,"dDurationMs":4240,"segs":[{"utf8":"we need it to hit against something something to stop the light so to speak."}]},{"tStartMs":148400,"dDurationMs":5120,"segs":[{"utf8":"Imagine you're at the drive-in theater enjoying your favourite movie but there's no screen,"}]},{"tStartMs":154560,"dDurationMs":3920,"segs":[{"utf8":"could you make out the image through these rays of light projected into the sky?"}]},{"tStartMs":159520,"dDurationMs":1600,"segs":[{"utf8":"No, didn't think so."}]},{"tStartMs":161120,"dDurationMs":8240,"segs":[{"utf8":"The second reason our spotlight setup doesn't work is because light is very very complicated."}]},{"tStartMs":169360,"dDurationMs":2720,"segs":[{"utf8":"Different light sources behave in different ways."}]},{"tStartMs":172080,"dDurationMs":4720,"segs":[{"utf8":"Take your run-of-the-mill light bulb here it radiates light in all directions."}]},{"tStartMs":176800,"dDurationMs":5600,"segs":[{"utf8":"We want light to be focused in one uniform direction so again you might think; spotlight"}]},{"tStartMs":182400,"dDurationMs":2560,"segs":[{"utf8":"right? Well, obviously it's not that easy."}]},{"tStartMs":185520,"dDurationMs":1040,"segs":[{"utf8":"Let's go run some tests."}]},{"tStartMs":188320,"dDurationMs":3520,"segs":[{"utf8":"As you can see we have our flashlight and Batman logo on stance."}]},{"tStartMs":191840,"dDurationMs":2960,"segs":[{"utf8":"Even with the Batman logo in front of the flashlight we"}]},{"tStartMs":194800,"dDurationMs":2800,"segs":[{"utf8":"still don't get a projected image onto the screen."}]},{"tStartMs":197600,"dDurationMs":2960,"segs":[{"utf8":"This is similar to our spotlight setup outside."}]},{"tStartMs":200560,"dDurationMs":2000,"segs":[{"utf8":"We just need one thing to make this work."}]},{"tStartMs":203440,"dDurationMs":560,"segs":[{"utf8":"A lens."}]},{"tStartMs":204640,"dDurationMs":2960,"segs":[{"utf8":"Not just any lens. A convex lens."}]},{"tStartMs":207600,"dDurationMs":4240,"segs":[{"utf8":"So if we just take this lens and put it in front of our light source...voila."}]},{"tStartMs":212400,"dDurationMs":3200,"segs":[{"utf8":"We have a projected Batman logo on the screen."}]},{"tStartMs":215600,"dDurationMs":3200,"segs":[{"utf8":"However this distance is very very specific."}]},{"tStartMs":219600,"dDurationMs":4640,"segs":[{"utf8":"If I move this Batman logo anywhere else it fades and disappears."}]},{"tStartMs":224240,"dDurationMs":1280,"segs":[{"utf8":"That begs the question."}]},{"tStartMs":225520,"dDurationMs":1600,"segs":[{"utf8":"How does this lens actually work?"}]},{"tStartMs":227680,"dDurationMs":4000,"segs":[{"utf8":"The curvature of the convex lens bends light coming out of it."}]},{"tStartMs":231680,"dDurationMs":2000,"segs":[{"utf8":"We call this refraction."}]},{"tStartMs":233680,"dDurationMs":4240,"segs":[{"utf8":"This light bends differently depending on how far away from the center of the lens we are."}]},{"tStartMs":237920,"dDurationMs":5360,"segs":[{"utf8":"Where it bends barely at the middle and more significantly at the edge,"}]},{"tStartMs":243280,"dDurationMs":4320,"segs":[{"utf8":"all this refracted light converges at one point on the other side of the lens."}]},{"tStartMs":247600,"dDurationMs":1840,"segs":[{"utf8":"We call this the focal point."}]},{"tStartMs":250160,"dDurationMs":4080,"segs":[{"utf8":"If we look at our setup we can actually see this happening in real time."}]},{"tStartMs":254240,"dDurationMs":3040,"segs":[{"utf8":"If I take my hand and put it right in that focal point I"}]},{"tStartMs":257280,"dDurationMs":2720,"segs":[{"utf8":"can make the bat signal disappear entirely."}]},{"tStartMs":261200,"dDurationMs":3360,"segs":[{"utf8":"Even if we take the Batman logo and put it right on the lens"}]},{"tStartMs":264560,"dDurationMs":4000,"segs":[{"utf8":"just like in the movies we still don't get a projected image on the screen."}]},{"tStartMs":269920,"dDurationMs":3600,"segs":[{"utf8":"If we put something at the focal point but on the other side of the lens"}]},{"tStartMs":273520,"dDurationMs":1680,"segs":[{"utf8":"with the light source behind it,"}]},{"tStartMs":275200,"dDurationMs":3040,"segs":[{"utf8":"we should be able to project a bat signal into the sky."}]},{"tStartMs":278240,"dDurationMs":1680,"segs":[{"utf8":"We just have to make sure our light source"}]},{"tStartMs":279920,"dDurationMs":3040,"segs":[{"utf8":"is powerful enough to project that image into the night sky."}]},{"tStartMs":282960,"dDurationMs":3680,"segs":[{"utf8":"That's why I've picked up these monsters of leds from lightning court."}]},{"tStartMs":286640,"dDurationMs":4080,"segs":[{"utf8":"Each one of these leds is 150 000 lumens."}]},{"tStartMs":290720,"dDurationMs":1760,"segs":[{"utf8":"We're going to use four of them."}]},{"tStartMs":292480,"dDurationMs":5120,"segs":[{"utf8":"To put that in perspective this is going to be brighter than our world's brightest flashlight."}]},{"tStartMs":298640,"dDurationMs":2240,"segs":[{"utf8":"That's so bright geez."}]},{"tStartMs":300880,"dDurationMs":3200,"segs":[{"utf8":"Oh and one more thing our batman logo is upside"}]},{"tStartMs":304080,"dDurationMs":3680,"segs":[{"utf8":"down and that's due to how convex lenses flip images."}]},{"tStartMs":307760,"dDurationMs":2080,"segs":[{"utf8":"I have a simple solution for this though."}]},{"tStartMs":313120,"dDurationMs":880,"segs":[{"utf8":"Perfect."}]},{"tStartMs":314000,"dDurationMs":5680,"segs":[{"utf8":"Our next step is to take all these components, scale them up and make it into a bat signal!"}]},{"tStartMs":319680,"dDurationMs":2480,"segs":[{"utf8":"This portion of the video is sponsored by Capital One Shopping."}]},{"tStartMs":322160,"dDurationMs":1840,"segs":[{"utf8":"I wanna talk to you today about shopping."}]},{"tStartMs":324000,"dDurationMs":4240,"segs":[{"utf8":"If you're anything like me yo