al for fans who can't see good."}]},{"tStartMs":401423,"dDurationMs":3475,"segs":[{"utf8":"Cue the clouds."}]},{"tStartMs":416320,"dDurationMs":2400,"segs":[{"utf8":"What is this?"}]},{"tStartMs":420880,"dDurationMs":2000,"segs":[{"utf8":"A bat signal for ants?!"}]},{"tStartMs":424080,"dDurationMs":1228,"segs":[{"utf8":"What..."}]},{"tStartMs":427360,"dDurationMs":4480,"segs":[{"utf8":"How can we expect our fans to know this is a bat signal if they can't even see how big it is?"}]},{"tStartMs":433120,"dDurationMs":1840,"segs":[{"utf8":"But James it's just a prototype."}]},{"tStartMs":434960,"dDurationMs":1760,"segs":[{"utf8":"I don't want to hear your excuses!"}]},{"tStartMs":436720,"dDurationMs":6408,"segs":[{"utf8":"The signal needs to be at least three times bigger than this."}]},{"tStartMs":445040,"dDurationMs":1531,"segs":[{"utf8":"He's absolutely right."}]},{"tStartMs":447520,"dDurationMs":2400,"segs":[{"utf8":"Thank you, I have a vision."}]},{"tStartMs":449920,"dDurationMs":1280,"segs":[{"utf8":"And so do I."}]},{"tStartMs":451200,"dDurationMs":2160,"segs":[{"utf8":"Let me show our design to the world."}]},{"tStartMs":453360,"dDurationMs":2080,"segs":[{"utf8":"And that concludes our broadcast day."}]},{"tStartMs":457280,"dDurationMs":2560,"segs":[{"utf8":"Well uh that was weird."}]},{"tStartMs":459840,"dDurationMs":500,"segs":[{"utf8":"Yeah."}]},{"tStartMs":461360,"dDurationMs":3680,"segs":[{"utf8":"Anyway uh this was obviously a prototype"}]},{"tStartMs":465040,"dDurationMs":4000,"segs":[{"utf8":"and James said we had to make it at least three times bigger."}]},{"tStartMs":469040,"dDurationMs":3440,"segs":[{"utf8":"So we have an expert on staff here"}]},{"tStartMs":472480,"dDurationMs":3360,"segs":[{"utf8":"at Hacksmith Industries that can make things three times bigger."}]},{"tStartMs":475840,"dDurationMs":1120,"segs":[{"utf8":"Akshat take it away."}]},{"tStartMs":476960,"dDurationMs":1760,"segs":[{"utf8":"I guess I'm the expert, that's pretty cool."}]},{"t