s"}]},{"tStartMs":546560,"dDurationMs":4880,"segs":[{"utf8":"on the bottom of this one so we took that it had to be really big from the games we're taking"}]},{"tStartMs":551440,"dDurationMs":10560,"segs":[{"utf8":"inspiration from that so that's a lot of work i think we should get started yeah i think so too"}]},{"tStartMs":562000,"dDurationMs":4000,"segs":[{"utf8":"this is what's going to make up our whole barrel structure we're going to first start off with"}]},{"tStartMs":566000,"dDurationMs":4400,"segs":[{"utf8":"the circle shapes these are what we call the ribs so they're going to help create the circle shape"}]},{"tStartMs":570400,"dDurationMs":5200,"segs":[{"utf8":"that the drum is known for and also allow us to mount things on the inside like our cymbals and"}]},{"tStartMs":575600,"dDurationMs":4560,"segs":[{"utf8":"our lenses giving some more structural rigidity to that is gonna be our one inch box tube which"}]},{"tStartMs":580160,"dDurationMs":5040,"segs":[{"utf8":"we're calling our bones so these bones are gonna help make sure that the system does not torque"}]},{"tStartMs":585200,"dDurationMs":4640,"segs":[{"utf8":"too much so when this heavy system is being moved around it's not gonna bend or distort in any way"}]},{"tStartMs":590400,"dDurationMs":3360,"segs":[{"utf8":"on the outside we're going to have our 16 gauge sheets of"}]},{"tStartMs":593760,"dDurationMs":4240,"segs":[{"utf8":"mild steel so we're going to be rolling these and then mounting them onto"}]},{"tStartMs":598000,"dDurationMs":4480,"segs":[{"utf8":"the barrel once we've completed the barrel we're going to need something real nice and sturdy to"}]},{"tStartMs":602480,"dDurationMs":4160,"segs":[{"utf8":"hold on to it so i had mike cut up this four inch box tube for us and that's gonna hold"}]},{"tStartMs":606640,"dDurationMs":4000,"segs":[{"utf8":"our bat signal we've got a lot of material to work with so let's start assembling it"}]},{"tStartMs":616480,"dDurationMs":4154,"segs":[{"utf8"